			<div class="col-sm-12">
				<h3>Chicago Pneumatic QRS Series Industrial Rotary Screw Air Compressors</h3>
				<img class="float-end" alt="Chicago Pneumatic" src="../images/site/chicago-pneumatic.gif">
				<p>
					Chicago Pneumatic is a leading manufacturer of compressed air products, specifically their rotary air compressor. Their QRS screw compressors are engineered for high performance, efficiency and reliability. A wide variety of industries relay on Chicago Pneumatic rotary compressors. Whether you are operating CNC machines, air tools, or processing equipment, the QRS series can handle the task.
				</p>
				<p>
					The QRS rotary screw compressors have a noise control enclosure. You can install the compressor almost anywhere in your workshop without disrupting others. The enclosure also keeps the internal components clean by protecting the system from ambient dust and debris.
				</p>
				<p>
					Many of their compressors also include a pre installed refrigerated air dryer. The integrated air dryer prevents water from flowing through the pipes and into your production equipment.
				</p>
				<p>
					The most popular industrial air compressor in the QRS line is their QRS 15D 150 TM. This 15hp screw air compressor includes a 120 gallon tank, integrated air dryer, and will displace 49cfm at 150psi. Chicago Pneumatic also offers single phase rotary screw compressors in stock for quick shipping.
				</p>
